      "category": "List-item",
      "text": "a. The Institute shall be governed by a Board consisting of the Deputy City Personnel Director for Personnel Development of the Department of Personnel, who shall serve as Chair, the Director of the Mayor's Office of Contracts, and a member of the public having substantial expertise in procurement management to be appointed by the Mayor for a two-year term upon the recommendation of the Procurement Policy Board. Such public member shall serve without salary, except that he or she shall be entitled to reimbursement for actual and necessary expenses incurred in the performance of official duties as a member of the Institute Board and shall also receive a per diem allowance when rendering services for the Institute Board at a rate established by the Mayor.",
